    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "MJoEF",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": -700,
      "name": "Annotation",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 420,
      "content": "Project components (new — called out under Decisions in the review pack). Built only from library tokens and library components:\n\n• List Item / Flight Standout — the library flight row plus a Tag / Label '2h30+' leading line 2, a 6 px bar and airtime in $color-primary.\n• Group Heading / Month — month (Manrope bold 16) + summary (14, text-secondary), 1 px bottom rule. Rendered as a real heading (h3).\n• Group Footer / Show All — library Link recoloured to text-primary for AA + chevron; a hidden 4 px swatch shows when a hidden row's track is hovered (AC 20).\n\nPlain and current rows are library instances (List Item / Flight, / Flight Current) with the date line removed and the secondary tier in $color-text-secondary."
    },
