      "content": "Pointer over a track whose row is collapsed: Camille's Plan de l'Aiguille → Le Savoy, 18 Sep (1h 07m, not a standout).\n\n• The month's 'Show all 7 flights in September 2026' row takes the current-row highlight and shows the flight's colour bar (orange).\n• Nothing expands and nothing scrolls. Clicking the track still opens the flight.\n• If the month is scrolled out of view, nothing visible changes (no auto-scroll).\n• The track drawing is illustrative: the map backdrop is a still."
    },
